     "words": "「夫聖人隨時以行，是謂守時。天時不作，弗為人客；人事不起，弗為之始。」 — \"The sage moves with the\ntime; this is called keeping to the time. When Heaven's time has not arisen, do not be the guest [the attacker];\nwhen human affairs have not arisen, do not be the one who begins.\" /
